# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research dumps and reference material (large, and license-contaminated)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# _research/ holds ~1 MB of markdown plus prototype trees; _research/prototypes/db2 and
# _research/prototypes/duckiebot contain gym-duckietown-derived meshes and MUST NEVER be
# committed (Duckietown assets are non-commercial with no redistribution grant).
# _refs/ holds the 32 MB reference jetbot.usd and other vendor downloads.
_research/
_refs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated USD, textures and other build artifacts (clean-room gate, SPEC S3.4)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only text .usda may ever be committed. Everything binary/opaque is banned outright and the
# generated USD tree is rebuilt locally with one command.
assets/usd/
*.usd
*.usdc
*.usdz
!*.usda
*.obj
*.glb
*.gltf
*.mtl
*.stl
*.dae
*.fbx
*.blend
*.hdr
*.exr

# Generated marking textures (rebuilt by citygen; only the generator is committed)
assets/textures/generated/

